    <node id="UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009">
      <data key="d0">UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009 is a legislative law and formal legal regulation issued by the Republic of Indonesia that serves as the primary legal framework for the nation’s aquatic and fisheries sectors. Enacted in 2009, this statute establishes the general provisions and principles for the management and utilization of Indonesia's fish resources. Its core purpose is to ensure the sustainability of aquatic resources while providing comprehensive protections for both maritime and inland water systems. This legislation acts as an amendment to Undang-Undang Nomor 31 Tahun 2004, providing a comprehensive framework for fishery business operations, including fishing operations, aquaculture, and fish farming. The scope of the law covers a broad spectrum of activities, including trade regulations and the establishment of requirements for business and investment licenses within the fisheries sector. Furthermore, it contains specific provisions regarding the handling, processing, and quality standards of fish, notably those outlined in Article 25A and various specific legal articles such as Pasal 100D.

Additionally, UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009 governs the logistical and administrative aspects of the maritime industry, including the registration of fishing vessels, the issuance of sailing permits, and the management of fishery ports. The law specifically defines the duties and authority of the Syahbandar (harbor master) at these locations and establishes formal legal provisions for fishery levies and the specific duties of fishery supervisors. To ensure regulatory enforcement, the law provides a framework for criminal procedures, judicial processes, and legal penalties within the fisheries sector. This includes the establishment of a fishery court and specific court sub-units, as well as defining the authority and powers of investigators tasked with handling fishery-related crimes and judicial procedures.

Furthermore, the identifier UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009 is also associated with a legal document containing regulations regarding the Indonesian prosecution system. This indicates that the identifier may also refer to a distinct legal framework or regulatory context concerning the nation's prosecution system, separate from the aquatic and fisheries regulations described above.&lt;SEP&gt;A legal regulation identified as Law Number 45 of 2009.&lt;SEP&gt;A legal document identified as UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009.&lt;SEP&gt;A law enacted in the year 2009, identified as Nomor 45.&lt;SEP&gt;A law or legal regulation identified as Number 45 of the year 2009.&lt;SEP&gt;A piece of Indonesian legislation enacted in 2009.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cc580ed1c232b689fe641ba4c1dc39ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c368c83da785235c86f2546f89c595c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98541969aacb0baa781142c1b4fa5791-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2fdc9a9662d10b1fc9e94c2612c18bed-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7d3630b0e5e1eae9e59afda8c825c66b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a001a80cfb487fd5f039f32e8dd78511-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-21bb841a49133bd551fd55758e087774-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1ffff1f2e3dfa130e836c0fbbe361e57-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b377d5c1c9fa053ec5fbdad0c5aa3f92-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2242493ffd0db986c3b97bbca014a1b2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b968e379f5f93fc0a5d3815d70225062-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c5f272acc0b47431bf705b7bdfc55b34-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1bea162916e428eae6c091a2345d5427-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d82baadc65d3fb83fcadf9d87e98f046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca77871eaf5880d4a99669013079d4d5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aa61d12e1a6bd23e3847f4b188fd7f70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7caa573ce907926dfb1d5d112debc427-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fb69a2d0a0540fabb87cf928d7548cfd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-089e68b7aa6c877eb9e209c4f4f2e477-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d130566d3428f4d3d39a686317900d8a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c0e48f703a1e3de0c91e2bd365a83e2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35609e3dadbb447e7323b8e7b23e171f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-534b2be954c51e78d8ba31786fe0d724-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-75e0a9225f4cfb6419813f0b2ea4b76d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8d4128dc7893e05931cc360e4d81024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78ed963f3dd3c00083f50735157dfe57-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c44edd751d8f9487281d09517df937d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b88209000d4eb14db342326f64a3dfee-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7c7df7266ef87827f0f041d4191c0cc8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be1e1a48929c3cc75053e1ab81db89aa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1f11d6172c173551b03490fc495047f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-85d2e87907b665692f0b9b9f5dfd1285-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e00760c5948bb624998b6696a7588dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-353540565da08516f4178b44d3a81468-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8cd1965b8838d4f4a2c74d182becb2dc-chun