    <node id="Ketentuan Umum">
      <data key="d0">Ketentuan Umum</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Ketentuan Umum refers to a specific section within a legal document, regulation, or legislative framework dedicated to general provisions. It serves as a foundational component of various legal instruments by establishing the initial principles, core definitions, and the overall scope of the text. By outlining these essential parameters, Ketentuan Umum creates the necessary groundwork for the consistent interpretation and application of all contents contained within the document.

In specific legislative contexts, such as the legal framework of UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009, Ketentuan Umum is identified as the section containing general provisions that provide introductory guidelines and parameters. In this instance, it serves to govern how the subsequent articles within that specific legislation are to be understood, implemented, and applied.&lt;SEP&gt;A general provisions section within the regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;A section of the legal document representing general provisions.&lt;SEP&gt;A general provisions section within a legal document.&lt;SEP&gt;A section heading representing general provisions within the law.&lt;SEP&gt;A general provision section within a legal document.&lt;SEP&gt;The general provisions section of the law.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-c368c83da785235c86f2546f89c595c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98541969aacb0baa781142c1b4fa5791-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2fdc9a9662d10b1fc9e94c2612c18bed-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7d3630b0e5e1eae9e59afda8c825c66b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a001a80cfb487fd5f039f32e8dd78511-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-21bb841a49133bd551fd55758e087774-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b377d5c1c9fa053ec5fbdad0c5aa3f92-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2242493ffd0db986c3b97bbca014a1b2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b968e379f5f93fc0a5d3815d70225062-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1bea162916e428eae6c091a2345d5427-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d82baadc65d3fb83fcadf9d87e98f046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aa61d12e1a6bd23e3847f4b188fd7f70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7caa573ce907926dfb1d5d112debc427-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fb69a2d0a0540fabb87cf928d7548cfd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-089e68b7aa6c877eb9e209c4f4f2e477-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d130566d3428f4d3d39a686317900d8a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-534b2be954c51e78d8ba31786fe0d724-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-75e0a9225f4cfb6419813f0b2ea4b76d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8d4128dc7893e05931cc360e4d81024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c44edd751d8f9487281d09517df937d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b88209000d4eb14db342326f64a3dfee-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7c7df7266ef87827f0f041d4191c0cc8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1f11d6172c173551b03490fc495047f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e00760c5948bb624998b6696a7588dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56ebef365151d711330ded1affec5c67-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-330531730b1c4f499e6f17ee7a15ed0d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3e28f0d7f60cc7a75874be8028f3f27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e12e737033c2a1e41296f691e1b69ed3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9ff7709481fc713a6e71c843157c22d0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0162fd6c66ce607d110c8d0e9db56ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8d0561e12317246bad13a7bc39f2771a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4e9406af38b0c427ef94a4fc5c16f60-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-130fe72853071a0776f0c882222dfbd8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c7080b95043ca54f656b25aec0737d16-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cffaac94ef2c2024bbb1488d40d770a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0c38afa935d3f42bd7aee8eebdf2787a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c7d038bdaf81cefbbd37a0dfd16d4380-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-239618d8936f6b556500eb440a1e0f79-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2727039291ac2002dd3e3bacae49f9a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a2584d4d1ad82841bc89b193a8bd0dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-87bebfa57c27e2833dc40481329bbdac-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a05e5e3d6dd91e52efb05258ace7e970-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0881021530ba5beed98eb3811461e27f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2ec00e764464408ee48c17ce78d241f8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad26a0781f780828d6ca06a34f757321-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-257b7735229f630684594ec31a887d03-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2f8702cbf0777165c01e708af22be300-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-00a12516bdf9b68ebeb990ad5ef891a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-730c2519d62d2f4f76af6a50779cee50-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-351e06bb3fe87e0083bbf71b06cef353-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96cb007884eba8ce96829a2e0ffab119-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29fbcbd5b65dd426e4716290318a0c00-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-58425585edf52a86897cd4b439cf810f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-150736e574b328ea081de79f5974e572-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9e6cdb99f3cdb98728cc64c27b027e2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1359332418ece67d5d88eef8516bfae6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a95cb1754e8bd0658e0f4814a0b2866-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-57b676e72bd7d33bfd818769b7f7fe7a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c9ddd9b5bee945f2f34ab7b627d39d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed0e6a14574cb6c8d219c7b423067dae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca600c74c446db876d0c55bd29f4d998-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8f43260542e30c39011c792f39a1f499-chunk-000</data>
