    <node id="Laut Lepas">
      <data key="d0">Laut Lepas</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A part of the sea not included in the ZEEI, Indonesian territorial sea, Indonesian archipelago waters, and Indonesian inland waters.&lt;SEP&gt;The high seas or open waters outside of national jurisdictions.&lt;SEP&gt;High seas where fishing vessels are permitted to operate.&lt;SEP&gt;The high seas or open ocean areas outside of national jurisdictions.&lt;SEP&gt;High seas where Negara Republik Indonesia exercises sovereign rights based on international standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3f250dcbafd593c2d06ce016eeea9d5f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-75e0a9225f4cfb6419813f0b2ea4b76d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-85d2e87907b665692f0b9b9f5dfd1285-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b92e3da08870a168c229ea3603a9355-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7c49841464685c342625bf812725d84b-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1793620284</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Pelabuhan Perikanan">
      <data key="d0">Pelabuhan Perikanan</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Pelabuhan Perikanan is a specialized port facility specifically dedicated to fishing activities and serves as a designated area for the landing of fish and the operation of fishery-related business system activities. It encompasses both land and surrounding waters, providing a designated space where fishing vessels can berth, anchor, and unload fish. The facility is equipped with maritime safety features and supports various fisheries-related support activities.

As a regulated port facility, Pelabuhan Perikanan is a site where a Syahbandar (Harbour Master) is appointed, and where maritime port infrastructure is constructed and managed. It functions as a hub for government activities, including the supervision and oversight of fishery operations. Additionally, Pelabuhan Perikanan is a location where fishery crime investigations are prioritized for certain investigators and is formally classified as a general category of fishing ports within relevant regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3f250dcbafd593c2d06ce016eeea9d5f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1ffff1f2e3dfa130e836c0fbbe361e57-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-353540565da08516f4178b44d3a81468-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0838a3f46d9a0838a242a520f5182f23-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-234faf2c9eddf47d34fafb6f84b1b01d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1c16bda5ef23b55bac217710e0aadedc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14b7f513c6f891bc73b891aeb09df792-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-505edc34f4b2995f33a1cb0504f5ee50-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1793622398</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Menteri">
      <data key="d0">Menteri</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The minister in charge of fisheries affairs.&lt;SEP&gt;A government official responsible for establishing fish management plans, allocations, and regulatory standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The government official who has the authority to establish plans, classifications, and standards for fishing ports.&lt;SEP&gt;The minister who has the authority to appoint fishery supervisors.&lt;SEP&gt;A government official responsible for establishing coordination forums for fishery crime investigations.&lt;SEP&gt;A high-ranking government official who coordinates the appointment of port authorities.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3f250dcbafd593c2d06ce016eeea9d5f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1ffff1f2e3dfa130e836c0fbbe361e57-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-353540565da08516f4178b44d3a81468-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a2584d4d1ad82841bc89b193a8bd0dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1c16bda5ef23b55bac217710e0aadedc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-505edc34f4b2995f33a1cb0504f5ee50-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1793622322</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Pemerintah">
      <data key="d0">Pemerintah</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Pemerintah is the central government and national executive governing body responsible for the regulation and development of fish resources. It serves as the primary authority for establishing and enforcing regulations, with a specific mandate to manage and regulate the usage of land and water for fish farming.

Furthermore, Pemerintah plays a critical role in nurturing and facilitating the national fisheries industry. It is tasked with fostering and organizing fishery business activities to create a healthy business climate and promote the overall development of the sector.

In addition to its role in economic and resource management, Pemerintah acts as the governing authority responsible for determining and socializing information regarding substances and tools that are harmful to human health and the environment. Through these diverse responsibilities, the entity ensures the sustainable management of aquatic resources while supporting the growth of the national fisheries industry.&lt;SEP&gt;The government entity responsible for providing approvals for fishing activities in other jurisdictions.&lt;SEP&gt;The government body responsible for organizing and developing the management of fishing ports.&lt;SEP&gt;The central government body responsible for managing fisheries information and data systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The governmental authority responsible for overseeing fishery regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The central government authority.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3f250dcbafd593c2d06ce016eeea9d5f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c5f272acc0b47431bf705b7bdfc55b34-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1bea162916e428eae6c091a2345d5427-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca77871eaf5880d4a99669013079d4d5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7caa573ce907926dfb1d5d112debc427-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d130566d3428f4d3d39a686317900d8a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c0e48f703a1e3de0c91e2bd365a83e2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35609e3dadbb447e7323b8e7b23e171f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-75e0a9225f4cfb6419813f0b2ea4b76d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-353540565da08516f4178b44d3a81468-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8d0561e12317246bad13a7bc39f2771a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4e9406af38b0c427ef94a4fc5c16f60-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c7d038bdaf81cefbbd37a0dfd16d4380-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1793616324</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Pemerintah Daerah">
      <data key="d0">Pemerintah Daerah</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The provincial and/or district/city governments.&lt;SEP&gt;The local government bodies responsible for implementing the management of water and land usage for fish farming.&lt;SEP&gt;Regional governments responsible for fostering and facilitating the development of fishery businesses.&lt;SEP&gt;The local government bodies responsible for regional fisheries management and data systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The regional or local government units.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3f250dcbafd593c2d06ce016eeea9d5f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca77871eaf5880d4a99669013079d4d5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d130566d3428f4d3d39a686317900d8a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8d0561e12317246bad13a7bc39f2771a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c7d038bdaf81cefbbd37a0dfd16d4380-chunk-000</data>
