    <node id="Negara Republik Indonesia">
      <data key="d0">Negara Republik Indonesia</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Negara Republik Indonesia is the sovereign nation and state of Indonesia, serving as the primary sovereign state territory and administrative entity. As a sovereign nation, it is responsible for the comprehensive governance and management of its territory and the diverse resources contained within its borders.

In the context of maritime and natural resource management, Negara Republik Indonesia is the sovereign jurisdiction where fish resource management policies, regulations, and specific fishing laws are implemented. It acts as the primary authority for managing fishing territories and fishery resources, serving as the main jurisdiction where fisheries management and enforcement activities take place. It is specifically recognized as the sovereign country whose fishery management area is governed by specified legislation, ensuring that all fishing activities and related laws are applied across its territory.

Furthermore, Negara Republik Indonesia is characterized as an archipelagic nation with vast fishing potential. This marine wealth is considered a vital backbone for the nation's development, integrating its role as a sovereign administrative power with its significant geographical and economic contributions.&lt;SEP&gt;The sovereign nation where legal cases are handled and distributed.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-1ffff1f2e3dfa130e836c0fbbe361e57-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2242493ffd0db986c3b97bbca014a1b2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-75e0a9225f4cfb6419813f0b2ea4b76d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78ed963f3dd3c00083f50735157dfe57-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be1e1a48929c3cc75053e1ab81db89aa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-85d2e87907b665692f0b9b9f5dfd1285-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-efe29281cb29cea02a55dc6d4a656fe4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-46a76389201b0a6d50af5e5091a79e2d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6163486fd141fd23207a47ad464aac20-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0881021530ba5beed98eb3811461e27f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96cb007884eba8ce96829a2e0ffab119-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7c49841464685c342625bf812725d84b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7c49841464685c342625bf812725d84b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f26a468a599a89a6e80b6507f8877645-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4592e0d50c45de90ca21650a7351e04c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9f6715071d75a5cc753b5c66ac15c904-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
