    <node id="Peraturan Menteri">
      <data key="d0">Peraturan Menteri</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Peraturan Menteri refers to a series of ministerial regulations that provide specific, detailed provisions across a wide range of operational and regulatory aspects within the fishery sector. These regulations are designed to elaborate on broader policies by establishing precise technical and administrative requirements.

Specifically, Peraturan Menteri details the procedures and conditions required for license issuance and provides the technical specifications for the registration of fishing vessels. They also encompass the definition of administrative and technical requirements necessary for various industry operations.

Furthermore, these regulations cover the standards for fishery product quality and identify the specific types of fishing equipment that are prohibited. Peraturan Menteri also establishes the framework for administrative sanctions and outlines the functional positions and responsibilities of fishery supervisors.&lt;SEP&gt;A ministerial regulation that provides detailed guidelines for the execution of duties by fishery supervisors.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-2242493ffd0db986c3b97bbca014a1b2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-089e68b7aa6c877eb9e209c4f4f2e477-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d130566d3428f4d3d39a686317900d8a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7c7df7266ef87827f0f041d4191c0cc8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-85d2e87907b665692f0b9b9f5dfd1285-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-353540565da08516f4178b44d3a81468-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9ff7709481fc713a6e71c843157c22d0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a2584d4d1ad82841bc89b193a8bd0dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-234faf2c9eddf47d34fafb6f84b1b01d-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1793616823</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Ayat (1)">
      <data key="d0">Ayat (1)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Ayat (1) is a structural designation in Indonesian legal texts representing the first paragraph or first clause of various articles (Pasal) across different legislative frameworks. Because it serves as a recurring structural label, the name refers to several distinct legal provisions and definitions depending on the specific article in which it appears.

In maritime and fishing regulations, Ayat (1) of Pasal 9 specifies the prohibition of harmful fishing tools. Separately, Ayat (1) of Pasal 25C provides a formal definition of the fishery industry, stating that it includes the provision of capture facilities and fishery processing.

The designation also applies to other specific legal requirements and procedural rules. It serves as the first paragraph of Pasal 28, the first paragraph of the amended Pasal 44, and a specific paragraph within Pasal 65. Furthermore, Ayat (1) is identified as the first paragraph of Pasal 48 within the context of UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009.

In other legal contexts, Ayat (1) functions as a subsection of Pasal 76B, which defines the conditions for auctioning evidence, and as the first clause of Article 27.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-2242493ffd0db986c3b97bbca014a1b2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8d4128dc7893e05931cc360e4d81024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e12e737033c2a1e41296f691e1b69ed3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-130fe72853071a0776f0c882222dfbd8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0c38afa935d3f42bd7aee8eebdf2787a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e36b555749beade4c744d39b6a9f5f42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29079ef829371b602ec75456a64d48a9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e6e336a5d4a7fc3c011daa61021382f-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1793621623</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Ayat (2)">
      <data key="d0">Ayat (2)</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Ayat (2) refers to a designation used for various second paragraphs or clauses across different legal articles and legislative frameworks. Because this term is used in multiple contexts, it represents several distinct provisions depending on the specific law or article being referenced.

In one instance, Ayat (2) of Pasal 9 specifies that the detailed rules associated with that section are governed by ministerial regulations. It is also identified as the second paragraph of Pasal 28 and the second paragraph of Pasal 48 within the legislative framework of UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009.

Furthermore, Ayat (2) refers to the second paragraph or subsection of Article 66 and the second paragraph of Article 23. In other contexts, it corresponds to the second clause of Pasal 25C, which is characterized as being sufficiently clear, as well as the second clause of Article 27. More generally, it is described as a specific paragraph or clause within a legal document that is stated as being sufficiently clear.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-2242493ffd0db986c3b97bbca014a1b2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8d4128dc7893e05931cc360e4d81024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-130fe72853071a0776f0c882222dfbd8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-239618d8936f6b556500eb440a1e0f79-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c959c5568aadd8aa4b3f1ba42789f215-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29079ef829371b602ec75456a64d48a9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e6e336a5d4a7fc3c011daa61021382f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9f6715071d75a5cc753b5c66ac15c904-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1793623874</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Pasal 14">
      <data key="d0">Pasal 14</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A specific article or clause within a legal framework.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific article in the law detailing the regulation of fish germplasm.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific article within Undang-Undang Nomor 5 Tahun 1983 tentang Zona Ekonomi Eksklusif Indonesia regarding investigation procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific article within UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009 that defines legal terms.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-b968e379f5f93fc0a5d3815d70225062-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c5f272acc0b47431bf705b7bdfc55b34-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed0e6a14574cb6c8d219c7b423067dae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f26a468a599a89a6e80b6507f8877645-chunk-000</data>
