    </node>
    <node id="Ayat (3)">
      <data key="d0">Ayat (3)</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Ayat (3) is a structural legal component that represents the third sub-clause, paragraph, or subsection of a specific article within a legislative framework. It serves as a distinct provision within a larger legal context, designating a specific point of law following the preceding clauses.

Specifically, Ayat (3) refers to the third paragraph added to Ketentuan Pasal 18 and the third paragraph added to Pasal 28. It also functions as the third paragraph or subsection of Article 66 and the third paragraph of Article 23.

In other legal contexts, Ayat (3) identifies the third clause of Pasal 25C, which is characterized as being sufficiently clear. Additionally, it refers to the third clause of Article 27, which is responsible for providing the definitions for SIPI Asli.&lt;SEP&gt;The third paragraph of Pasal 28 which provides the official definitions for SIKPI Asli and the requirements for carrying it.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-b968e379f5f93fc0a5d3815d70225062-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d82baadc65d3fb83fcadf9d87e98f046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aa61d12e1a6bd23e3847f4b188fd7f70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8d4128dc7893e05931cc360e4d81024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-239618d8936f6b556500eb440a1e0f79-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c959c5568aadd8aa4b3f1ba42789f215-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29079ef829371b602ec75456a64d48a9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e6e336a5d4a7fc3c011daa61021382f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-130a45a160a3017c0ca1c8575057bcbd-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1793621665</data>
