    <node id="Wilayah Pengelolaan Perikanan Negara Republik Indonesia">
      <data key="d0">Wilayah Pengelolaan Perikanan Negara Republik Indonesia</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Wilayah Pengelolaan Perikanan Negara Republik Indonesia is the designated geographic and maritime territory managed by the Republic of Indonesia specifically for fishing purposes. It serves as the official fishery management area under the jurisdiction of the Indonesian nation, defining the specific zones where the government conducts maritime oversight.

This managed fishery zone encompasses the specific geographic fishing management areas where the Republic of Indonesia provides oversight and administration. It is the primary maritime territory utilized by the nation to regulate and manage fisheries within its designated boundaries.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-78ed963f3dd3c00083f50735157dfe57-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be1e1a48929c3cc75053e1ab81db89aa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-234faf2c9eddf47d34fafb6f84b1b01d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6163486fd141fd23207a47ad464aac20-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1c16bda5ef23b55bac217710e0aadedc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96cb007884eba8ce96829a2e0ffab119-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b92e3da08870a168c229ea3603a9355-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f26a468a599a89a6e80b6507f8877645-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7aded5d5e52a1e434667c92c52046b41-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1793623412</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
