    <node id="Penjelasan Resmi">
      <data key="d0">Penjelasan Resmi</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Penjelasan Resmi is the formal official explanation or commentary provided within a legal or legislative framework. It functions as a dedicated section within a legal document, legislative document, or a piece of legislation specifically intended to clarify the specific laws or provisions contained therein. As a core component of a legal structure, Penjelasan Resmi serves as the official explanation section of a law or legal statute, providing the clarifying text associated with the legislation.

Furthermore, Penjelasan Resmi encompasses the official explanations provided specifically for regulations. By serving as an authoritative guide, it ensures that the meaning, intent, and application of the legal requirements are clearly communicated within the context of the relevant official documentation. It provides essential context and clarification for specific regulations, ensuring that the underlying objectives of the legal documents are accurately conveyed.

In practical application, Penjelasan Resmi represents the official explanation associated with various legal documents. A specific instance of this is the official explanation section associated with UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009.&lt;SEP&gt;The official explanation associated with UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009.&lt;SEP&gt;The official explanation section of a legal document.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cca60df9cadc486c73618bfbb730896f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-36c3ae33efeb279f1b62d98a2e97c2d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2a7f63233750f66081316ef941910c77-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cc28dddc30044cc1042074e2da6ac17e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92ba2597efb922956560d533a5a31039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c959c5568aadd8aa4b3f1ba42789f215-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56e3cd581ac503887943f89380a4d0ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f7591804ef6b0260481efd8940a4d936-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9ffe642df7854b84d7f20364797237f1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29079ef829371b602ec75456a64d48a9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e6e336a5d4a7fc3c011daa61021382f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d7b3c2cbd5310c0cc3c016c5673bf723-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-794138606a8f23ea6ad84d8579369963-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4f6ed3ea2d02a0da67c28b9a23765440-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-960d94c55d2317a253dca8fdbafce903-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9700f1780cacfcc2ead5d8af0bd2c56e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-82926bd59be32ff65a813b5f207afd46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3787f4285214a35d011af741af67626d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280da26ed64551efd8a164f961cf4c8a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b44570403cf6eaa8997bd94799962174-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5a6db25f57414eaaed9e9761392457a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae2e1433cd75bdf11990702e40192356-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-04c53fbabb68ed3c40f9ca040f7e0391-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5d8a267584f27610ac6d30619611c53e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e261c4446876dafa5abbaf556b1ad31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5d23a953ecfe86af32907090015262b1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-130d25c13390c77e967eb54b853ed45e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5d5894862e25e3fd2a4e6d247d9baad4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b0ede3419aab57c0712803baf91351d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9138b5fd8dd535b7cd9f52ce85e266b8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0036e187990de6a4b6155199e9b6488e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-19263e8108dba1ec6192453b78961b6a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0854b937923cdf1341df12b0b9db337b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-41676dc3de5137959e24fcc3188115fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c53acfff1b48fb8baa2f83b8d7232f2-chun