    <node id="Cukup Jelas">
      <data key="d0">Cukup Jelas</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A legal notation indicating that a specific provision is sufficiently clear and requires no further explanation.&lt;SEP&gt;A statement or status indicating that a provision is sufficiently clear and does not require further elaboration.&lt;SEP&gt;A phrase indicating that the content is sufficiently clear or self-explanatory.&lt;SEP&gt;The Indonesian phrase 'Cukup jelas' signifying that a legislative provision is sufficiently clear.&lt;SEP&gt;A legal phrase indicating that a provision is self-explanatory and does not require further explanation.&lt;SEP&gt;A status or phrase indicating that a legal provision is sufficiently clear and requires no further explanation.&lt;SEP&gt;A qualitative descriptor indicating that a subject is sufficiently clear or understandable.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-36c3ae33efeb279f1b62d98a2e97c2d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5d5894862e25e3fd2a4e6d247d9baad4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-19263e8108dba1ec6192453b78961b6a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-abb2cf826efcef2b41801b56d435fdd8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-924ec6b1bf259ea21504688aef27f94e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0baa1cabb53315ba0d4e8c0bd1be49a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49de9010af68a226b0c09835cbb33b9b-chunk-000</data>
