      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009" target="Ketentuan Umum">
      <data key="d7">58.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation (Ketentuan Umum, UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009) identifies the structural relationship between a specific legislative section and a primary legal act. Ketentuan Umum, which translates to General Provisions, is a recognized and fundamental section within the legal regulation known as UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009.

The legislative act, UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009, officially includes and contains the Ketentuan Umum section as part of its internal structure. As a primary section of this legal framework, Ketentuan Umum is established as an integral and foundational component, confirming its position within the overall architecture of the law.&lt;SEP&gt;UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009 contains the Ketentuan Umum section.&lt;SEP&gt;Ketentuan Umum is a general provision section of UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009.&lt;SEP&gt;Ketentuan Umum is a section within UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009.&lt;SEP&gt;Ketentuan Umum is a section of UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009.</data>
      <data key="d9">Component,Component of,Contains,Hierarchy,Includes,Part Of,Part of,Section,Section Of,Section of,belongs to,component,contains,defines,includes,inclusion,part of,section,section of</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-c368c83da785235c86f2546f89c595c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98541969aacb0baa781142c1b4fa5791-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2fdc9a9662d10b1fc9e94c2612c18bed-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7d3630b0e5e1eae9e59afda8c825c66b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a001a80cfb487fd5f039f32e8dd78511-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-21bb841a49133bd551fd55758e087774-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b377d5c1c9fa053ec5fbdad0c5aa3f92-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2242493ffd0db986c3b97bbca014a1b2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b968e379f5f93fc0a5d3815d70225062-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1bea162916e428eae6c091a2345d5427-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d82baadc65d3fb83fcadf9d87e98f046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aa61d12e1a6bd23e3847f4b188fd7f70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7caa573ce907926dfb1d5d112debc427-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fb69a2d0a0540fabb87cf928d7548cfd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-089e68b7aa6c877eb9e209c4f4f2e477-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-534b2be954c51e78d8ba31786fe0d724-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-75e0a9225f4cfb6419813f0b2ea4b76d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8d4128dc7893e05931cc360e4d81024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9c44edd751d8f9487281d09517df937d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b88209000d4eb14db342326f64a3dfee-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7c7df7266ef87827f0f041d4191c0cc8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1f11d6172c173551b03490fc495047f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e00760c5948bb624998b6696a7588dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56ebef365151d711330ded1affec5c67-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-330531730b1c4f499e6f17ee7a15ed0d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f3e28f0d7f60cc7a75874be8028f3f27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e12e737033c2a1e41296f691e1b69ed3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0162fd6c66ce607d110c8d0e9db56ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8d0561e12317246bad13a7bc39f2771a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4e9406af38b0c427ef94a4fc5c16f60-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-130fe72853071a0776f0c882222dfbd8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c7080b95043ca54f656b25aec0737d16-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cffaac94ef2c2024bbb1488d40d770a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0c38afa935d3f42bd7aee8eebdf2787a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c7d038bdaf81cefbbd37a0dfd16d4380-chu