    <edge source="UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009" target="Penjelasan Resmi">
      <data key="d7">41.0</data>
      <data key="d8">(Penjelasan Resmi, UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009) refers to a specific section within the Indonesian law known as UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009. This component serves as the official explanation, providing necessary clarity regarding the various provisions and contents established within the legislation.

By including the Penjelasan Resmi section, UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009 ensures that official clarifications and interpretations are integrated directly into the legal framework of the document. This inclusion provides a comprehensive and authoritative guide regarding the application and meaning of the law's requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009 provides the Penjelasan Resmi.&lt;SEP&gt;UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009 contains the Penjelasan Resmi section.&lt;SEP&gt;UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009 contains the official explanation.&lt;SEP&gt;UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009 contains the Penjelasan Resmi.&lt;SEP&gt;UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009 includes the Penjelasan Resmi.&lt;SEP&gt;UU Nomor 45 Tahun 2009 includes the official explanation section.</data>
      <data key="d9">Contains,Explanation,Includes,Official explanation,associated_with,clarification,contains,explanation,includes,official explanation,part of,provides</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-cca60df9cadc486c73618bfbb730896f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-36c3ae33efeb279f1b62d98a2e97c2d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2a7f63233750f66081316ef941910c77-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cc28dddc30044cc1042074e2da6ac17e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92ba2597efb922956560d533a5a31039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c959c5568aadd8aa4b3f1ba42789f215-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56e3cd581ac503887943f89380a4d0ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f7591804ef6b0260481efd8940a4d936-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9ffe642df7854b84d7f20364797237f1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29079ef829371b602ec75456a64d48a9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d7b3c2cbd5310c0cc3c016c5673bf723-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-794138606a8f23ea6ad84d8579369963-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4f6ed3ea2d02a0da67c28b9a23765440-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9700f1780cacfcc2ead5d8af0bd2c56e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-82926bd59be32ff65a813b5f207afd46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3787f4285214a35d011af741af67626d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280da26ed64551efd8a164f961cf4c8a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b44570403cf6eaa8997bd94799962174-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5a6db25f57414eaaed9e9761392457a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae2e1433cd75bdf11990702e40192356-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5d8a267584f27610ac6d30619611c53e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e261c4446876dafa5abbaf556b1ad31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5d23a953ecfe86af32907090015262b1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-130d25c13390c77e967eb54b853ed45e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5d5894862e25e3fd2a4e6d247d9baad4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b0ede3419aab57c0712803baf91351d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9138b5fd8dd535b7cd9f52ce85e266b8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0036e187990de6a4b6155199e9b6488e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-19263e8108dba1ec6192453b78961b6a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0854b937923cdf1341df12b0b9db337b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-41676dc3de5137959e24fcc3188115fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c53acfff1b48fb8baa2f83b8d7232f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-abb2cf826efcef2b41801b56d435fdd8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-924ec6b1bf259ea21504688aef27f94e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0baa1cabb53315ba0d4e8c0bd1be49a-chu