    <edge source="Kapal Penangkap Ikan" target="SIPI">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Owners or operators of fishing vessels are required to possess a SIPI.&lt;SEP&gt;A Kapal Penangkap Ikan must possess a SIPI to conduct legal fishing.</data>
      <data key="d9">requires</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-75e0a9225f4cfb6419813f0b2ea4b76d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b92e3da08870a168c229ea3603a9355-chunk-000</data>
